{title: 260 - Hover O'er Me, Holy Spirit}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Holy Spirit}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[F]Hover [C7]o'er me, [F]Holy Spirit, Bathe my trembling heart and [C]brow;
[F]Fill me [C7]with Thy [F]hallowed presence, Come, O come and [C7]fill me [F]now.
[C]Fill me now, [F]fill me now, [Bb]Jesus, [F]come and fill me [C]now.
[F]Fill me [C7]with Thy [F]hallowed presence, Come, O come and [C7]fill me [F]now.

Refrain:
[F]Fill [C7]me now, [F]fill [C]me now,
[F]Jesus, [C7]come [F]and [C7]fill [F]me now.
[C]Fill [F]me [Bb]with [F]Thy [C]hallowed presence,
[F]Come, [C7]O [F]come and [C7]fill [F]me now.

Verse 2:
[F]Thou [C7]canst fill [F]me, [C]gracious Spirit,
[F]Though [C7]I [F]cannot [C7]tell [F]Thee how;
[C]But [F]I [Bb]need Thee, [F]greatly [C]need Thee;
[F]Come, [C7]O [F]come and [C7]fill [F]me now.

Verse 3:
[F]I [C7]am weakness, [F]full [C]of weakness;
[F]At [C7]Thy [F]sacred [C7]feet [F]I bow;
[C][F]Blest, [Bb]divine, [F]eternal [C]Spirit,
[F]Fill [C7]with [F]love, and [C7]fill [F]me now.

Verse 4:
[F]Cleanse [C7]and comfort, [F]bless and [C]save me;
[F]Bathe, [C7]O, [F]bathe my [C7]heart [F]and brow;
[C]Thou [F]art [Bb]comforting [F]and [C]saving,
[F]Thou [C7]art [F]sweetly [C7]filling [F]now.
